        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GDP6250011SBR, 11-3/4\" Bamboo Pulls for Glass Shower  Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 11-3/4 Inch Bamboo Shower Door Pull Set comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it back-to-back on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower door including 2 pulls and 2 sets of rosettes. Choose from a huge selection of finishes from the most popular including polished chrome and some more unique colors like matte black.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP02-specifications.gif?v=1704354739\" width=\"580\" height=\"267\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions GDP6250011SBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/small-bamboo-shower-door-pull-first-impressions-sd-gdp625005sbr\"><b>Small Bamboo Shower Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach shower door pull is hand finished by the master craftsmen at First Impressions International in your choice of 10 different high quality finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SD-GDP6250011SBR Bamboo Shower Door Pull</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.09\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</i>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP02-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions SD-GDP6250011SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls, 4 decorative rosettes, and mounting hardware for back-to-back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
